WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:02,230
To the east of Su's family is the Yangtze River

2
00:00:02,230 --> 00:00:04,430
I originally wanted to try my luck at the logistics port.

3
00:00:04,430 --> 00:00:07,030
Unexpectedly, thousands of containers were emptied

4
00:00:07,030 --> 00:00:09,700
It seems that the official has been here a long time ago

5
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,700
Cloth leather, hardware swords, small household appliances

6
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:16,020
These things will be useful in the future

7
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:18,220
There is also a cargo ship on the river

8
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:19,420
Go and have a look

9
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:21,420
We are running out of water transportation.

10
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:31,100
The crew are all gone

11
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:32,300
The goods are still there

12
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:34,100
The most valuable thing about a freighter is not just the cargo.

13
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,500
And fuel

14
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:38,500
There are dozens of tons of diesel left

15
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:40,100
But I only have two empty tanks

16
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:41,830
Maximum capacity of two tons

17
00:00:42,030 --> 00:00:43,430
I just received so many goods

18
00:00:43,430 --> 00:00:47,100
Maybe there's a fuel tank inside.

19
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:50,860
Jade Hundred Swords

20
00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:52,760
The real thing is less than 10%

21
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:54,360
But it can be absorbed by space

22
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:55,360
Finally no white palm
